  },
  {
    num: '03',
    title: 'Market',
    body: 'Is there real, current hiring in your city or a metro you are willing to relocate to, or work remotely for? Chennai, Bangalore, and Hyderabad host most of India\'s medical coding and healthcare BPO hiring, driven by US hospitals and revenue-cycle-management companies outsourcing coding work. Check live openings on company career pages before committing to a course.',
